  "item_short_desc": "<p>Brave the cold with Rothco&rsquo;s Extra Heavyweight Buffalo Plaid Sherpa Lined Shirt, a rugged fusion of warmth and durability. Crafted from thick 100% cotton flannel and lined with soft sherpa fleece, this heavyweight work shirt doubles as an insulated overshirt built for the outdoors. Whether you're on the job, at the campsite, or off the grid, this cold-weather essential delivers dependable comfort, classic buffalo check style, and tough-as-nails performance.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "5148",
  "description": "<p>Brave the cold with Rothco&rsquo;s Extra Heavyweight Buffalo Plaid Sherpa Lined Shirt, a rugged fusion of warmth and durability. Crafted from thick 100% cotton flannel and lined with soft sherpa fleece, this heavyweight work shirt doubles as an insulated overshirt built for the outdoors. Whether you're on the job, at the campsite, or off the grid, this cold-weather essential delivers dependable comfort, classic buffalo check style, and tough-as-nails performance. Sherpa-Lined for Peak Warmth: Lined through the body with thick sherpa lining, this insulated plaid overshirt traps heat and holds it in. The sherpa-lined shirt is built to keep you warm through frosty mornings, long shifts outdoors, and late nights by the fire. Cold-Weather Durability Meets Function: Featuring a reinforced button front, wrist cuffs, and dual chest pockets with secure flaps, this heavyweight outdoor shirt combines utility and style. The rugged cotton shell withstands outdoor use while offering easy access to everyday carry items. Designed for Dirt, Cold, and Grit: Crafted from 100% heavyweight cotton, this durable plaid work shirt stands up to the demands of harsh weather and daily wear. From hauling gear to clearing brush, the shacket is a cold-weather essential for any job site or backwoods mission. Built for the Outdoors: Whether you're stacking firewood, hitting the trail, or kicking back at camp, this buffalo check shirt jacket delivers serious warmth and lasting comfort. Wear it solo or throw it over your base layer, either way, it&rsquo;s your go-to gear for unpredictable weather and tough terrain. Iconic Style with Real Utility: The bold buffalo plaid pattern is more than just classic, it's a staple of rugged American outerwear. Available in multiple colors, these insulated overshirts make the perfect gift for any outdoorsman, adventurer, or hard-working weekend warrior.</p>",
